---
import SmartDownload from './SmartDownload.astro';
import {desktopRelease,androidRelease} from '../utils/releaseInfo';
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
 <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span>给交大师生的开源工具</p>
 <h1 id="hero-title">把一学期的资料，<br/><span>整理到一起。</span></h1>
 <p class="hero-description">课程文件、课堂录播、云盘备份与课表日程。<br class="desktop-break"/>少一些来回切换，查找和保存都更顺手。</p>
 <SmartDownload/>
 </div>
 <aside class="hero-note" aria-label="平台与版本"><div class="note-mark">学期有序<br/><span>学习从容</span></div><div class="version-row"><span>桌面应用</span><strong>v{desktopRelease.version}</strong></div><div class="version-row"><span>安卓应用</span><strong>v{androidRelease.version}</strong></div><p>Windows / macOS / Linux / Android<br/>不同平台提供独立安装包与功能。</p></aside>
</section>
